Arabic language pack (Maktaba, Epic 52, stories 52.4 and 52.15)

The pack's code, its dialect and confusion lists and samples.txt are Maktaba's.

Its data comes from two Epic 51 assets, never bundled here:

- lang.ar: the Ayaspell Hunspell dictionary for Arabic (ar.aff / ar.dic) from
  LibreOffice's dictionaries repository, tri-licensed GPL 2+ / LGPL 2.1+ / MPL 1.1. It is
  data, read at run time, never linked.
- model.refine: CAMeL Tools' MSA morphology database (calima-msa-r13), GPL v2, fetched
  with the ML runtime. CAMeL Tools' code is MIT.

The Quran check compares verse runs with the bundled Tanzil Quran Text (Simple Clean,
v1.1), Copyright (C) 2007-2026 Tanzil Project, CC BY 3.0, used verbatim
(data/quran/LICENSE-TANZIL.txt). Verse words shown as suggestions credit
"Quran text: Tanzil Project (tanzil.net)".
